    "body": "In general it would be good to align `FrozenArray<>` more with `ObservableArray<>`, in order to fix #810. See my previous plan in https://github.com/heycam/webidl/issues/810#issuecomment-538651524, which I think still holds and is more or less what I did for `ObservableArray<>`",
